WEBVTT

00:15.370 --> 00:17.000
Owww…

00:18.640 --> 00:22.480
If you want to accept people,
you have to face them first.

00:22.970 --> 00:25.180
And you can do that.

00:25.510 --> 00:28.150
And far as I can see,
you want to accept people.

00:31.510 --> 00:33.910
Dammit, what am I even thinking…

00:33.910 --> 00:35.860
- Good morning, Sakura.
- Morning, Sakura!

00:40.980 --> 00:43.620
Wh-What gives?! How long have you been here?!

00:43.860 --> 00:47.550
For ages. We tried to get your attention.
Were you lost in thought?

00:47.790 --> 00:50.180
Wh-What are you smiling about?!

00:50.210 --> 00:50.640
Huh?

00:51.020 --> 00:54.690
You were doing the smiling. It was funny.

00:56.190 --> 00:58.580
I wasn't smilin' or nothin'!

01:01.820 --> 01:06.200
Come on, Sakura. You don't have to
be that embarrassed.

01:06.410 --> 01:08.220
Shut up. Leave me alone.

01:08.420 --> 01:09.900
U-Um…

01:10.080 --> 01:13.460
Is it just me or is everyone looking at us…?

01:13.630 --> 01:15.380
Yeah, they would.

01:15.630 --> 01:17.850
It's fine. Looks don't kill.

01:18.250 --> 01:20.090
You gotta get used to it.

01:20.170 --> 01:21.420
Ooh, they're here!

01:21.420 --> 01:22.650
- Finally!
- Hey, they're here!

01:22.820 --> 01:24.970
Dudes, I heard some crazy rumors!

01:25.020 --> 01:26.910
You went at it with Lion's Head?!

01:27.040 --> 01:28.310
How'd it go?!

01:28.310 --> 01:29.820
Give us the deets!

01:29.970 --> 01:32.220
Wow, we're getting interviewed.

01:32.220 --> 01:33.660
N-Now I get it.

01:33.880 --> 01:36.620
The guys in the hall
wanted to ask about this, too.

01:36.860 --> 01:37.990
Ask them!

01:38.040 --> 01:38.670
Eh?!

01:41.930 --> 01:43.140
It's all you, Nire.

01:43.230 --> 01:44.040
Ehhh?!

01:44.300 --> 01:45.000
Uh…

01:46.400 --> 01:47.640
You fought, too?

01:47.640 --> 01:48.730
I don't see scabs.

01:48.730 --> 01:49.990
Who are you, anyway?

01:52.540 --> 01:55.990
I-I'm Nirei Akihiko, and I'll explain everything!

01:55.990 --> 01:57.840
Hey, hang on a sec.

01:58.460 --> 02:01.000
Let me hear it, too.

02:06.530 --> 02:09.400
Man, nothin' beats banana-flavored protein shakes.

02:11.100 --> 02:13.020
Tsu-Tsu-Tsu-Tsu-Tsuge…

02:14.250 --> 02:16.660
Hey, wasn't he also workin' out yesterday?

02:16.890 --> 02:19.940
H-He was! He's a bit of an oddball,

02:20.170 --> 02:23.650
but I think he's just as
strong as Sugishita or Suo!

02:27.110 --> 02:27.660
Hey.

02:28.050 --> 02:32.320
Been a hot minute, Suo. Feel like
answerin' my question yet?

02:32.440 --> 02:35.980
Ugh, didn't I already tell you
I don't want to answer it?

02:35.980 --> 02:39.090
Suo, are you and Tsugeura already acquainted?

02:39.180 --> 02:40.750
Yeah, I guess so.

02:41.070 --> 02:43.310
Whatever. Guess I'll hit Sakura now.

02:44.530 --> 02:46.830
I got a question for ya.

02:48.020 --> 02:48.190
What's yer aesthetic?!

02:48.190 --> 02:50.160
[Flex]
What's yer aesthetic?!

02:50.410 --> 02:53.490
There it is! The famed "what's yer aesthetic"!

02:53.490 --> 02:54.670
That again?

02:54.740 --> 02:57.180
He hit us with it yesterday.

02:57.630 --> 02:59.160
My… uh…

02:59.170 --> 03:00.350
Not your uhsthetic!

03:00.440 --> 03:01.700
Your aesthetic!

03:01.770 --> 03:03.280
Y'know, what yer about!

03:03.460 --> 03:07.440
I wanted to ask ya yesterday,
but I didn't finish my reps in time!

03:08.320 --> 03:11.190
Hey, man, what are you even askin' that for?

03:11.370 --> 03:12.790
Whaddaya mean?!

03:13.030 --> 03:15.500
[Aesthetic]
A guy's aesthetic shows what he lives for!

03:15.500 --> 03:18.000
[Aesthetic]
It'd be a waste not to ask!

03:18.000 --> 03:19.410
[Aesthetic]
Oh, I totally get that!

03:19.410 --> 03:20.030
[Aesthetic]
Ooh!

03:20.420 --> 03:25.230
It takes more than numbers to get a good picture
of a guy. You need his thoughts, too!

03:25.430 --> 03:27.810
Like how you put your right shoe on first,

03:27.940 --> 03:30.820
and you only drink Sakasu protein shakes!

03:30.820 --> 03:32.610
Whoa, how'd you know that?!

03:34.100 --> 03:38.460
Oh, that notebook! You're a shrimp,
but you got strong aesthetics!

03:38.640 --> 03:40.250
N-Naw, it's not all that…

03:40.250 --> 03:42.090
You don't gotta be so modest!

03:42.300 --> 03:43.670
What's with that guy?

03:43.750 --> 03:45.400
They sure hit it off…

03:45.750 --> 03:48.650
Pretty sure I'd get annoyed quick.

03:48.820 --> 03:51.020
Is he actually that strong?

03:51.180 --> 03:52.370
Ah, yeah.

03:52.760 --> 03:53.890
He's strong.

03:55.560 --> 03:56.980
Oh, that's right!

03:57.160 --> 03:59.710
Everyone wants to hear about Sakura, yeah?!

03:59.800 --> 04:01.880
We might as well all meet after school,

04:01.950 --> 04:04.900
and talk aesthetics over food 'n' drink!

04:04.900 --> 04:06.040
Oooh!

04:06.410 --> 04:10.330
- My gran asked me to mow her lawn today.
- I gotta see the dentist.

04:10.330 --> 04:11.990
It's my girlfriend's birthday…

04:11.990 --> 04:13.180
The heck?

04:13.280 --> 04:14.740
Everyone's busy?

04:14.910 --> 04:15.820
Looks like it.

04:16.410 --> 04:17.550
How dumb is he?

04:17.720 --> 04:19.710
They're both so trusting.

04:21.630 --> 04:25.130
Oh, Sugishita! Great timing!

04:27.070 --> 04:29.000
What, you busy, too?

04:29.250 --> 04:31.610
No, I think this is different.

04:32.100 --> 04:34.220
Well, how about just the four of us?

04:34.620 --> 04:36.900
I'll take ya to my favorite place!

04:37.240 --> 04:37.990
Okay!

04:38.110 --> 04:39.790
No. No way. Never.

04:39.920 --> 04:40.870
I'll pass, too.

04:40.870 --> 04:44.550
What? Come on, Sakura, they might have good food!

04:46.130 --> 04:48.270
That "never" softened up quick.

04:49.220 --> 04:50.400
Shut up!

06:22.810 --> 06:25.950
[Muscle Power]

06:26.040 --> 06:27.960
Wooooow!

06:27.970 --> 06:30.070
You're surprisingly forceful, Nire…

06:30.310 --> 06:33.180
So this is Tsugeura's favorite restaurant!

06:34.020 --> 06:35.510
Over here, guys!

06:35.930 --> 06:38.900
Can you even get a decent meal
at a place like this?

06:39.370 --> 06:41.100
Oh, uh…

06:41.160 --> 06:42.760
Ya hungry, Sakura?

06:43.170 --> 06:45.910
I recommend the protein okonomiyaki!

06:46.130 --> 06:48.950
There's no flour, so it's high-protein, low-sugar,

06:49.110 --> 06:50.330
and great for muscles!

06:50.460 --> 06:52.000
Wow, nice and healthy!

06:52.300 --> 06:54.710
Huh. The picture looks tasty!

06:54.900 --> 06:58.060
I envy your simplicity, Sakura.
I'll stick with water.

06:58.370 --> 07:00.380
You like eatin', Sakura?

07:00.550 --> 07:03.230
If ya got preferences, that's an aesthetic, too.

07:03.290 --> 07:05.760
Th-They're not really preferences…

07:06.080 --> 07:08.000
Ya like keepin' yer secrets, huh?

07:08.140 --> 07:10.520
Whatever. In that case…

07:11.550 --> 07:12.520
Let's fight.

07:14.440 --> 07:15.030
Huh?

07:15.300 --> 07:18.860
You were pretty cool when ya said
you'd be top dog the other day.

07:19.300 --> 07:23.900
Ain't no way a guy who can say somethin'
so big for a crowd has no aesthetic.

07:24.460 --> 07:27.280
Preferrin' not to say might also be an aesthetic,

07:27.620 --> 07:28.950
but if that's yours,

07:29.660 --> 07:31.440
tell me with your fists.

07:33.070 --> 07:35.320
Fights are conversations, Sakura.

07:37.850 --> 07:39.370
Sounds fun.

07:46.520 --> 07:48.430
Oh, wow.

07:48.730 --> 07:51.190
This is one interesting place.

07:51.330 --> 07:52.980
But, hey, it should work…

07:53.520 --> 07:54.260
Oho?

07:54.610 --> 07:55.950
That guy…

07:57.610 --> 08:00.440
Hey, guys. What a coincidence.

08:04.550 --> 08:06.210
If it ain't Kiryu!

08:06.420 --> 08:07.580
Wanna sit with us?!

08:07.630 --> 08:08.730
See ya.

08:09.120 --> 08:10.160
Let's sit in back.

08:10.160 --> 08:12.090
- Man, talk about hasty.
- Um, okay.

08:12.090 --> 08:14.000
Th-That's Kiryu!

08:14.070 --> 08:15.780
Oh, that's what got you?

08:16.310 --> 08:17.200
There you go.

08:17.200 --> 08:19.210
Th-Thank you…

08:23.340 --> 08:25.430
Your legs aren't hurting, are they?

08:26.030 --> 08:26.750
Here you go.

08:27.020 --> 08:30.670
Oh, thanks. Man, you're all bulked up.

08:30.750 --> 08:33.010
This is amazing! Incredible! Unbelievable!

08:33.390 --> 08:38.270
We have four of the five strongest guys
I've researched in Class 1-1 here!

08:38.410 --> 08:41.100
Looks like yer havin' a blast,
Nirei. Good on ya!

08:41.510 --> 08:44.590
Lucky you, Sakura! You made the top five.

08:44.910 --> 08:48.030
H-H-H-How strong is he…?

08:48.330 --> 08:50.230
I'm glad you asked!

08:50.750 --> 08:54.380
Apparently he went to Kanna Middle,
where all the rich kids go,

08:54.530 --> 09:00.730
but rumor has it that he beat a delinquent
school's third-years by himself in year one!

09:01.200 --> 09:02.180
What else?

09:02.370 --> 09:05.100
You're really into it today, Sakura!

09:05.400 --> 09:05.970
Wait…

09:05.970 --> 09:07.010
Hurry!

09:07.510 --> 09:09.820
I. Need. Info!

09:10.090 --> 09:12.160
Why are you turning red?

09:12.160 --> 09:14.020
Wh-Who cares?! Hurry up!

09:14.220 --> 09:17.380
- Look at all these interesting dishes!
- It seems he's popular with the ladies.

09:17.590 --> 09:20.090
Speaking of, that uniform's from Seikai Girls'.

09:20.180 --> 09:21.460
Is she his girlfriend?

09:21.460 --> 09:22.830
Not that info!

09:22.930 --> 09:26.510
Sakura's desperate for a topic
other than their relationship.

09:26.710 --> 09:27.270
Huh?

09:27.510 --> 09:30.910
What, you interested in Kiryu, Sakura?

09:31.160 --> 09:34.670
In that case, hey, Kiryu! Come on, let's chat!

09:34.670 --> 09:35.550
Hey, don't…

09:35.550 --> 09:37.120
Come here, let's all talk!

09:37.350 --> 09:38.590
She can come too!

09:38.590 --> 09:40.470
Don't make this worse!

09:40.550 --> 09:43.310
Sakura says he wants to know more aboutcha!

09:50.470 --> 09:53.320
Oh, your name's Sakura?

09:53.510 --> 09:56.710
Sorry, I knew your face, but not your name.

09:56.820 --> 09:58.650
You fought Sugi, yeah?

09:58.760 --> 10:02.190
See?! Kiryu wantsta know more about you, too!

10:02.960 --> 10:04.040
Mm-hm.

10:04.560 --> 10:07.660
But I'm busy right now,
so let's save it for school.

10:08.220 --> 10:09.050
Decided yet?

10:10.660 --> 10:13.400
So all that did was embarrass me.

10:13.520 --> 10:14.870
That's not all it did.

10:15.130 --> 10:17.560
Everyone has their own interests, after all.

10:17.750 --> 10:19.510
- Hey, don't be so cold, man!

10:19.510 --> 10:20.360
- Tsugeura, wait!
- Hey, don't be so cold, man!

10:20.360 --> 10:21.020
- Tsugeura, wait!
- You ain't told me yer aesthetic yet, Kiryu!

10:21.020 --> 10:23.180
- You ain't told me yer aesthetic yet, Kiryu!

10:23.290 --> 10:25.000
Let's all chat!

10:25.190 --> 10:26.070
'Kay?!

10:28.680 --> 10:30.380
Sorry about this.

10:30.710 --> 10:34.390
But it's okay. They're from Furin, just like me.

10:35.030 --> 10:36.920
But I get it. It's scary.

10:39.900 --> 10:41.980
Could you stop?

10:44.060 --> 10:45.590
Huh? Stop what?

10:45.780 --> 10:47.130
Hey, Tsuga…

10:47.270 --> 10:48.590
My name's Tsugeura.

10:48.990 --> 10:50.260
Hey, Tsuge,

10:50.470 --> 10:53.090
have you ever thought about how you look?

10:53.370 --> 10:56.030
Huh? What do you mean? I look like me.

10:56.830 --> 11:00.380
You're big, and you look strong.

11:00.910 --> 11:03.170
That scares some people, you know.

11:03.610 --> 11:08.320
And girls have a hard time dealing with
big guys when they start shouting.

11:10.500 --> 11:13.650
You'll never get a girl like that.

11:15.030 --> 11:17.560
Uh, hey, this looks bad…

11:18.460 --> 11:19.700
You…

11:20.540 --> 11:23.500
You were scared? Sorry 'bout that…

11:23.500 --> 11:24.430
He apologized?!

11:26.960 --> 11:29.680
It's a bit noisy here. Let's find someplace else.

11:31.390 --> 11:33.200
I-I'm real sorry, 'kay?

11:33.260 --> 11:34.650
He's whispering…

11:42.250 --> 11:44.940
Did that not getting a girl bit hit you that hard?

11:45.160 --> 11:46.110
Nah, man.

11:46.790 --> 11:50.620
Accidentally scarin' folks ain't my aesthetic.

11:50.940 --> 11:53.130
He's surprisingly sensitive.

11:53.730 --> 11:54.740
Oi, oi, oi!

11:54.740 --> 11:57.690
Found 'em! Surround 'em!

11:57.690 --> 11:59.490
Wh-What's that about?

11:59.980 --> 12:03.030
Man, you're way too persistent.

12:03.880 --> 12:06.450
You made a big mistake earlier, pal.

12:06.730 --> 12:09.180
You're the one who made a mistake.

12:09.410 --> 12:13.210
You were scaring her.
How you gonna make up for that?

12:15.280 --> 12:16.580
What's all this?!

12:17.320 --> 12:19.140
What's goin' on here?

12:19.300 --> 12:20.170
Hmm?

12:20.470 --> 12:24.090
I happened across this guy trying to
take this girl somewhere,

12:24.160 --> 12:27.220
so I socked him one and we made a run for it.

12:27.710 --> 12:28.400
Oh…

12:28.470 --> 12:33.260
Didn't expect him to get a whole gang
to find her, though. Take the hint, man.

12:33.560 --> 12:36.090
So she's not his girlfriend.

12:36.260 --> 12:37.400
She sure isn't.

12:39.240 --> 12:41.630
Kiryu, yer so cool!

12:42.240 --> 12:44.140
Th-Thanks?

12:44.220 --> 12:48.420
So your aesthetic is takin' care of women, yeah?!

12:48.530 --> 12:50.700
Mhm! That's good! It's good!

12:50.700 --> 12:53.100
Um, now's not the time for this.

12:53.330 --> 12:56.920
Hey, orange punk! We got business with Pinky!

12:57.040 --> 13:00.220
And the way you don't
admit it is so cool! I like it!

13:00.400 --> 13:02.510
Hey! You listenin' to me?!

13:02.570 --> 13:04.850
Tsuge? Later. Let's do this later.

13:04.850 --> 13:07.480
I always had ya pegged for a good guy!

13:07.830 --> 13:09.520
Don't ignore me!

13:14.390 --> 13:15.560
Seriously…

13:17.750 --> 13:20.790
Ganging up and surrounding people is lame.

13:20.990 --> 13:23.270
- You bastard!
- We'll get you for that!

13:23.600 --> 13:26.780
I hate guys like you.

13:26.920 --> 13:30.260
S-Sakura, you don't have to provoke them…

13:31.960 --> 13:34.670
Nice one, Sakura! Well said!

13:35.880 --> 13:37.490
That was satisfying.

13:38.030 --> 13:39.850
Let's get some distance.

13:40.910 --> 13:42.400
Don't you worry.

13:44.140 --> 13:46.990
Those three are really strong.

13:58.460 --> 14:02.190
You're hurt, ain'tcha, Sakura?
Sure you don't wanna sit out?

14:02.390 --> 14:04.470
Huh? What are you talkin' about?

14:04.780 --> 14:07.650
Man, sorry I got you guys into this.

14:07.750 --> 14:11.430
Hey, Furin! I don't care if you're
the town's shield or its shit!

14:11.430 --> 14:13.140
Don't get fulla yourselves!

14:13.220 --> 14:14.950
Tch. Buncha scum.

14:15.020 --> 14:17.560
Well, let's clean 'em right up.

14:17.560 --> 14:18.610
Get 'em!

14:18.890 --> 14:21.070
Alright, bring it!

14:25.170 --> 14:27.320
What?! Um, Tsugeura?!

14:27.590 --> 14:29.670
Those muscles just for show?!

14:30.090 --> 14:33.710
Dammit, this is what you get
for worrying about other people!

14:33.930 --> 14:36.060
You're dead now!

14:38.500 --> 14:43.130
It's my policy to let folks
get one punch in on me first.

14:43.940 --> 14:47.080
But now it's my turn!

14:50.990 --> 14:53.510
A G-German suplex?!

14:53.560 --> 14:55.450
Everything about him is showy, huh?

14:55.600 --> 14:56.550
Up we go!

14:57.000 --> 14:59.690
Let them show their stuff, then show them mine!

15:00.380 --> 15:02.680
That's my aesthetic!

15:03.660 --> 15:05.840
He's gonna die young, for sure.

15:11.730 --> 15:14.390
The hell, man?! Why are you throwin' them at me?!

15:14.470 --> 15:15.500
Oh, sorry.

15:15.630 --> 15:18.940
I thought this'd end faster
if I sent them that way, so…

15:22.250 --> 15:23.710
Huh?! Screw you!

15:23.750 --> 15:25.420
Nice! Keep 'em comin'!

15:33.710 --> 15:36.880
Kiryu is making Sakura and Tsugeura fight for him?

15:37.290 --> 15:39.020
Is he doing it for fun?

15:39.090 --> 15:39.880
Nope.

15:40.640 --> 15:44.620
Kiryu, you don't need to worry about her.

15:45.340 --> 15:46.490
You have me here.

15:48.850 --> 15:50.030
Gotcha.

15:51.150 --> 15:52.190
This guy…

15:53.970 --> 15:55.790
You think you can take it easy?!

15:55.980 --> 15:59.300
Of course I do. This is easy.

16:05.900 --> 16:09.350
Ooh! Nice, Suo! The rumors were right!

16:10.250 --> 16:14.190
He was making sure nobody could get over there?

16:15.470 --> 16:16.570
Kiryu, behind you!

16:17.030 --> 16:17.730
Eh?

16:22.630 --> 16:25.300
Oh, thanks, Sakura.

16:26.550 --> 16:27.660
…my way.

16:27.700 --> 16:28.180
Huh?

16:28.510 --> 16:31.870
I'm game. Send 'em all my way.

16:33.970 --> 16:36.860
Woo! You're such a nice guy, Sakura!

16:37.300 --> 16:41.170
I-I'm not doing this for you!
It works better for me this way!

16:41.170 --> 16:43.420
Kiryu! Give me some, too! Give me some!

16:48.400 --> 16:49.550
Wow…

16:50.420 --> 16:52.150
What is there to say…?

16:54.090 --> 16:55.630
They're incredible.

16:56.190 --> 16:58.610
Damn, they weren't even worth fighting.

16:58.800 --> 17:02.730
We cleaned up so fast. You two sure are something.

17:03.040 --> 17:05.030
Sakura, say it!

17:05.420 --> 17:06.410
Say what?

17:06.700 --> 17:10.970
Bofurin's creed! I'm lettin' you
do the coolest part!

17:11.450 --> 17:11.960
Huh?

17:12.110 --> 17:15.680
Sakura's from out of town,
so I don't think he knows it.

17:15.780 --> 17:17.310
Oh, that so?!

17:17.500 --> 17:19.430
Alright, memorize this!

17:21.860 --> 17:23.890
If you bring trouble,

17:24.120 --> 17:28.370
or harm people or property beyond here…

17:28.730 --> 17:32.790
Bofurin will purge you, no matter who you are!

17:33.270 --> 17:36.090
You didn't have to yell so loud.

17:36.320 --> 17:37.790
Those words…

17:38.270 --> 17:40.260
They said them back then, too.

17:41.180 --> 17:43.890
Well, that's how it goes, so…

17:45.660 --> 17:50.120
If you think you're strong, try using it
for something good next time, okay?

17:50.720 --> 17:52.750
O-Okay…

17:56.740 --> 17:58.970
No more pickin' on folks, okay?!

17:59.670 --> 18:01.630
Alright, that's that done.

18:02.290 --> 18:03.610
You're safe now.

18:04.410 --> 18:05.090
Th…

18:05.620 --> 18:07.140
Thank you!

18:07.770 --> 18:10.870
I really… can't thank you enough!

18:13.430 --> 18:15.060
Take care now.

18:15.880 --> 18:20.040
Man, I knew you were strong
from your fight with Sugi, but…

18:20.780 --> 18:22.630
You're amazing, Sakura.

18:22.980 --> 18:26.900
Ain't he? Makes sense, he's aimin' for the top!

18:27.060 --> 18:28.460
Huh? He is?

18:28.540 --> 18:30.960
Didn'tcha hear 'im the other day?

18:31.150 --> 18:33.830
I mean, I definitely heard a commotion,

18:33.990 --> 18:36.040
but I was in a groove in my game.

18:36.300 --> 18:38.270
Oh, but I guess…

18:38.500 --> 18:41.570
I'm glad I learned before we
picked our grade rep.

18:42.140 --> 18:43.510
Huh? Grade rep?

18:43.880 --> 18:46.710
Forget that. Sakura, gimme your contact info.

18:46.890 --> 18:47.550
Huh?!

18:47.810 --> 18:49.560
I-I want it, too!

18:51.170 --> 18:53.260
How do I do that?

18:53.320 --> 18:55.960
Give it here. And why are you blushing?

18:56.660 --> 18:58.990
Oh, you don't have the app?

18:59.290 --> 19:00.780
Then let's find your number…

19:01.960 --> 19:04.070
One contact…

19:04.620 --> 19:05.580
Weather?

19:07.190 --> 19:08.030
What?

19:11.530 --> 19:13.340
Why are you laughing?!

19:13.400 --> 19:15.890
Guess Sakura's the guy to ask for the weather!

19:24.610 --> 19:27.640
What's got you so glued to your phone? A game?

19:27.780 --> 19:29.640
Wh-Where'd that come from?!

19:29.750 --> 19:32.340
Uh, sorry, I didn't think you'd be that startled.

19:32.720 --> 19:35.790
And finish your food before you're late.

19:36.280 --> 19:38.030
[Sakura Haruka, 4 friends. Kiryu Mitsuki,
Tsugeura Taiga, Suo Hayato, Nirei Akihiko]

19:39.490 --> 19:40.700
Give it back already.

19:40.750 --> 19:42.340
I added myself.

19:42.340 --> 19:44.340
Wh-Why would you add yourself?!

19:44.930 --> 19:47.310
You caught Kotoha's contact info!

19:48.530 --> 19:49.490
Seriously?

19:50.390 --> 19:51.020
Hm?

19:51.040 --> 19:51.460
[Nirei Akihiko: Good morning]

19:51.460 --> 19:52.170
[Kiryu Mitsuki: Mornin']

19:52.170 --> 19:53.140
[Tsugeura Taiga: Good morning!]

19:53.140 --> 19:54.490
[Suo Hayato: Morning]
Huh? Why are they…?

19:54.890 --> 19:58.420
We'll meet at school, but they're
still chatting on their phones?

19:59.010 --> 20:00.760
[Nirei Akihiko: You were all so cool yesterday!
When are we choosing our grade rep, by the way?]

20:04.270 --> 20:06.270
[What's a gr]

20:08.020 --> 20:08.480
[Kiryu Mitsuki: You guys were off two days ago.]

20:08.480 --> 20:08.770
[Kiryu Mitsuki: And we didn't do it yesterday.]

20:08.770 --> 20:09.100
[Kiryu Mitsuki: We're probably gonna do it
when everyone's in class.]

20:09.100 --> 20:09.270
[Kiryu Mitsuki: Maybe today?]

20:09.270 --> 20:11.820
[Wait a sec, what's a grade rep suppo]

20:11.820 --> 20:13.280
[Roger!]

20:14.530 --> 20:15.280
[Kiryu Mitsuki: Listen to this! Yesterday…]

20:15.280 --> 20:16.030
[Tsugeura Taiga: Oh? What's this?]

20:16.030 --> 20:16.400
[Kiryu Mitsuki: I started playing
this fun new game.]

20:16.400 --> 20:16.780
[Kiryu Mitsuki: You should try it.]

20:16.780 --> 20:17.030
[Nirei Akihiko: A recommendation?]
[Tsugeura Taiga: A game?! I should try it out!]

20:17.030 --> 20:17.150
[Suo Hayato: What kind of game?]
[Nirei Akihiko: I wanna play!]

20:17.150 --> 20:17.280
[Kiryu Mitsuki: It's like this…]

20:25.240 --> 20:26.330
Oh, Sakura!

20:27.130 --> 20:28.330
Good morning!

20:28.520 --> 20:29.240
Morning!

20:29.250 --> 20:30.100
Mornin', bud!

20:30.160 --> 20:32.380
The hell's a grade rep?!

20:32.470 --> 20:34.710
Hey, why are you so mad?!

20:34.710 --> 20:38.980
And why are you sending messages
for things we could just say here?!

20:39.060 --> 20:41.570
What? I mean, texting's more convenient.

20:41.820 --> 20:44.770
I saw the read receipts
and thought you were reading,

20:44.880 --> 20:49.120
but it can be tough if you're
not used to it. But don't worry, Sakura.

20:49.610 --> 20:51.410
We're about to discuss just that.

20:52.800 --> 20:56.280
Those are the Tamon Squad's second-year
grade rep and vice reps.

20:56.410 --> 20:58.220
Alrrright, listen up!

20:58.770 --> 20:59.790
Those guys…

21:00.280 --> 21:01.870
I remember them.

21:02.040 --> 21:06.060
Wow, this is amazing! They're famous
among the second-years!

21:06.200 --> 21:07.300
Enomoto!

21:07.380 --> 21:09.410
Crrram it and sit down!

21:09.470 --> 21:10.720
And Kusumi,

21:10.990 --> 21:12.160
and even Kaji!

21:12.470 --> 21:14.200
I get to see them so close up!

21:14.950 --> 21:18.090
What's with this guy?
He's the only one not into this.

21:18.420 --> 21:21.930
You guys arrre about to choose
yourrr grrrade rrrep!

21:22.420 --> 21:25.200
A grrrade rrrep orrrganizes theirrr class,

21:25.270 --> 21:26.770
and keeps 'em safe!

21:26.810 --> 21:30.240
All the class's prrroblems
become theirrr rrresponsibility!

21:30.700 --> 21:34.470
Nominate anyone. Even yourrrself!
Just get it overrr with!

21:34.580 --> 21:38.270
So the grade rep is basically the class's top dog…

21:39.050 --> 21:41.010
Someone like him, huh?

21:41.660 --> 21:42.320
Here.

21:42.750 --> 21:45.110
Oh, Suo, you wanna do it?

21:45.570 --> 21:48.820
I didn't expect him to
put his own name into the ring.

21:51.580 --> 21:53.590
I think Sakura would be good for it.

21:53.690 --> 21:54.190
Hm?

21:55.340 --> 21:56.530
Huh?!

21:57.000 --> 22:00.010
[#11: New Friends]

23:30.390 --> 23:32.610
So you have a smartphone after all!

23:32.710 --> 23:34.570
Of course I do! I'm no bumpkin!

23:34.570 --> 23:36.570
Of course not! Lemme see.

23:36.700 --> 23:38.600
No pictures…

23:38.800 --> 23:41.020
Only default apps…

23:41.180 --> 23:43.080
And your contacts are…

23:43.830 --> 23:44.590
Weather…?
